    <description>This is a Record-Triggered Flow.
This flow is triggered after an appointment is created or updated. It checks if the appointment is booked and if the patient&apos;s record is null. If both conditions are met, it retrieves an email template with the developer name &apos;Confirmation_Email&apos;. Then, it sends an acknowledged email using the retrieved template to the patient&apos;s email address.

Several objects and their fields worth mentioning. Below are the details (the format is given as: object_name - field_name: interaction)
  * Appointment__c - Appointment_Booked__c : Checks if the appointment is booked.
  * EmailTemplate - DeveloperName : Uses this field to retrieve the email template.</description>
